Ornaments stand between books on Spines shelves
Long-press the page counter: List, then Spines
Top menu > Theme > Ornaments picks which ones
Select none, then Select all on the Ukiyo-e tab
Apply, and the shelf shows that set
Long-press an ornament to adjust it
Place moves it along the shelf
Switch off takes it off the shelf
Tap Done to close
Your shelf, your ornaments
